# Public URL of the Cloudflare Worker that proxies "Ask Claude" (worker/).
# Not a secret: it ships in the built JavaScript. Committed so that local and
# CI (GitHub Actions) builds both include it. The API key lives only in Cloudflare.
VITE_AI_WORKER_URL=https://astro-ai.astro-ai.workers.dev

# Page origins the Worker accepts (keep in step with ALLOWED_ORIGINS in
# worker/wrangler.toml). Elsewhere (the GitHub Pages copy, the claude.ai
# artifact) the Ask Claude panel is not shown, since its requests would be refused.
VITE_AI_ORIGINS=https://fairflow.co.uk,http://localhost:8322
